  {
   "id": "ROOMES00:13b03",
   "off": 80643,
   "op": "28",
   "group": "menu",
   "jp": "宿の外",
   "en": "Leave inn",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES00:13b17",
   "off": 80663,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "感じのいい宿だ\u0010\rホールは ずいぶん\rにぎわっている\u0010",
   "en": "A nice, cosy inn.\u0010 The hall is bustling.\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES00:13b54",
   "off": 80724,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「申し訳ないんだが\r  部屋がいっぱいなんだよ\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"Sorry, but we're full up.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES00:13b83",
   "off": 80771,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  冒険の記録なら\r  できるんだが…",
   "en": "I can still record your adventure, though...",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES00:13ba6",
   "off": 80806,
   "op": "27",
   "group": "choice",
   "jp": "記録する",
   "en": "Save",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES00:13baf",
   "off": 80815,
   "op": "27",
   "group": "choice",
   "jp": "記録しない",
   "en": "Don't save",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES00:13bc3",
   "off": 80835,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  夜はぶっそうだから\r  気をつけるんだな」\u0010",
   "en": "It's not safe at night, so watch yourself.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES00:13bff",
   "off": 80895,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「まだ､寝るには\r  早いから､そこいら辺\r  うろついてきたら？」",
   "en": "\"It's still too early for bed. Why not take a wander around?\"",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES00:13c53",
   "off": 80979,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "いらっしゃい",
   "en": "Welcome!",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES00:13c7d",
   "off": 81021,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「悪い時期に来てしまった\r  ようだな\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"Looks like you've come at a bad time.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES00:13ca4",
   "off": 81060,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  今日から戒厳令がしかれ\r  たから 通行証を持って\r  ないと\u0010\b  この北地区から\r  でられないんだ」\u0010",
   "en": "Martial law came in today, so unless you've got a pass,\u0010\byou can't get out of the North District.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES00:13d08",
   "off": 81160,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「今 このへんじゃ\r  反逆者狩りをやってんだ\u0010\b  あんたも気を付けたほうが\r  いいぜ」\u0010",
   "en": "\"They're hunting rebels around here right now.\u0010\bYou'd better watch yourself too.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES00:13d66",
   "off": 81254,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「あんた傭兵かい？\u0010\b  あんたと同じ様に\r  泊まれなくなった\r  傭兵達は\u0010\b  酒場で夜を明かす\r  らしいぜ」\u0010",
   "en": "\"You a mercenary?\u0010\bI hear the mercenaries who couldn't get a room, same as you,\u0010\bare spending the night in the tavern.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES00:13dd1",
   "off": 81361,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「近々､王国の娘より\r  重大な発表があるそうだ\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"Word is the Daughter of the Kingdom will soon make an important announcement.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES00:13e01",
   "off": 81409,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  モーダルグロウの繁栄は\r  大聖堂にいる王国の娘の\r  おかげだよ」\u0010",
   "en": "Modalglow owes its prosperity to the Daughter of the Kingdom in the Cathedral.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  }
 ]
}
